SUMMARY:Ian Winter: Revolution!
LOCATION:Just the Tonic at The Caves\, 253 Cowgate\, Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Ian Winter is a Hull comedian with a style described as a box o
 f all sorts. Brave. Funny. Edgy. Dark. Ironic. Surreal. Dry and held togeth
 er with one-liners. A comedian unafraid to throw stones at Cathedrals and K
 ings. Ian's previous Edinburgh Fringe highly acclaimed shows include Gordon
 \, a one-man play\, and Twisted Tongue\, a performance poetry show. Ian is 
 a writer\, actor and poet. His shows and style are full of energy\, viscera
 l\, and honest to the core.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atla
 s/event/ian-winter-revolution-25361/
